    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45cb702f9ea0a368bc601b41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知道她这段话是出自掌管学园的\n“理事长”身份，\n还是喜爱赛马娘的她的真心想法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "db0301884aec028df35b426b3ba1dfebe022e3a9ddc44252d882ede3583bdcfc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
