      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，想这个也没意义！\n而且既然她知道我要出道了，\n就表示她一定有在关注我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b153e3859c558adcd9c27cae22f8cae3bb6a6a6438ed91b70862407e3819fd0e",
