      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先不论她刚刚说的“多努力一点”……\n总之，秋川理事长的期待似乎给了她很大的鼓励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57de76843d3d9cb2a516f52ec2b97561fe69a578ce639b248c6dec65bedbc694",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
