      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，我跟既“平凡”又很有上进心，\n却也有些少根筋的她\n一起朝着胜利努力的日子就此展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8622d5da7c3f8ca0ae0cdd37010fce38e6794d1cf55cd426d8bfe2f575e4cae9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
